/ Bloc « Pizza Party » de la fiche séjour (issue #339). Il vit DANS le
  turbo-frame des paiements : rattacher une party bouge le Total séjour et
  l'Encaissé, les trois doivent se rafraîchir ensemble.
- parties = @stay.party_reservations.ordered
- configure = TranchesDeVie::Client.configured?
.mt-4.border-t.border-gray-200.pt-4
  .flex.items-baseline.justify-between.gap-2
    .text-xs.font-semibold.uppercase.tracking-wide.text-gray-500 Pizza Party
    - if parties.any? && configure
      = button_to "Actualiser", sync_stay_party_reservations_path(@stay), method: :post, class: "text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800"

  - if parties.any?
    ul.mt-2.space-y-2
      - parties.each do |party|
        li.rounded-md.border.bg-white.p-2 class=(party.active? ? "border-gray-200" : "border-red-200 bg-red-50/40")
          .flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-2
            .min-w-0
              .text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-900 = party.summary.presence || "Pizza Party"
              - unless party.active?
                div class="mt-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-red-700"
                  - if party.external_refunded_at.present?
                    = "#{party.status_label} le #{l(party.external_refunded_at.to_date, format: :short)}"
                  - else
                    = party.status_label
              - if party.external_number.present?
                div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500" = party.external_number
            span.shrink-0.text-sm.font-semibold.text-gray-900 = humanized_money_with_symbol(party.price)
          .mt-1.flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-3
            - if party.external_admin_url.present?
              = link_to "Voir sur Tranches de Vie", party.external_admin_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800"
            = button_to "Détacher", stay_party_reservation_path(@stay, party), method: :delete, form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Détacher cette Pizza Party du séjour ? Son paiement sera retiré de l'encaissé." } }, class: "text-xs text-red-600 hover:text-red-800"
  - else
    p.mt-2.text-sm.text-gray-500 Aucune Pizza Party rattachée.

  - if configure
    / Le choix des candidates se charge à la demande dans son propre frame :
      inutile d'appeler Tranches de Vie à chaque ouverture de la fiche séjour.
    = turbo_frame_tag "stay_#{@stay.id}_party_candidates", class: "block"
      .mt-2
        = link_to "Rattacher une Pizza Party", stay_party_reservations_path(@stay), data: { turbo_frame: "stay_#{@stay.id}_party_candidates" }, class: "inline-block rounded-md border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-100"
  - else
    .mt-2.rounded-md.bg-gray-50.px-3.py-2
      span.text-sm.text-gray-500 Connexion à Tranches de Vie non configurée
      button.ml-2.cursor-not-allowed.rounded-md.bg-gray-200.px-3.py-1.text-sm.text-gray-500 disabled="disabled"
        | Rattacher une Pizza Party
